  "intro_paragraph_1_html": "Hi, I'm <span class=\"bg-accent-yellow text-black px-1 transform -skew-x-6 inline-block font-bold\">Sara</span>. I'm a video editor who believes in the rhythm of the cut. I don't just assemble clips; I orchestrate emotions.",
